  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding for Pillar 01 2022 01 IPSARD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to complete the national broiler sector model of Vietnam, which was preliminary developed in 2021, and link it to the micro-level to assess external impacts on representative broiler farms. The model is used as a tool to identify, analyse and forecast, to support policy formulation and consultation in the agricultural field. The capacity of IPSARD researchers will be strengthened through the activities of research and model construction.</narrative>
  </description>
